#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:11
#: 8bea60f5ece341a6afd0841b40428b1f
msgid ""
"This article explains how to *manually* set up the :ref:`SITL ArduPilot "
"Simulator <sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>` in a virtual machine "
"environment on Windows, and connect it to a Ground Control Station"
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何在 Windows 的虚拟机环境中*手动*设置 :ref:`SITL ArduPilot 仿真器 <sitl-simulator-"
"software-in-the-loop>`，并将其连接到地面控制站。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:16
#: 373603313054484caf2cf0854bdc5852
msgid ""
"See :ref:`Setting up SITL using Vagrant <setting-up-sitl-using-vagrant>` for"
" a more automated setup process."
msgstr ""
"如需更自动化的设置流程，请参阅 :ref:`使用 Vagrant 设置 SITL <setting-up-sitl-using-vagrant>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:20
#: 8334a3a401d340f49458389686525f98
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:22
#: 75560c2f39f14dfc91ae3feff4ec17af
msgid ""
"The SITL (Software In The Loop) simulator allows you to run Plane, Copter or"
" Rover without any hardware. The simulator runs the normal ArduPilot code as"
" a native executable on a Linux PC. SITL can also be run within a virtual "
"machine on Windows, Mac OSX or Linux."
msgstr ""
"SITL（软件在环）仿真器允许您在无需任何硬件的情况下运行 Plane、Copter 或 Rover。该仿真器将正常的 ArduPilot "
"代码作为本地可执行文件在 Linux PC 上运行。SITL 也可以在 Windows、Mac OSX 或 Linux 上的虚拟机中运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:27
#: 85749072a5c5494192f4cdb61608df97
msgid ""
"This article shows how to manually set up SITL on a Linux environment hosted"
" in a VMware virtual machine. You can use any Virtual Machine provider such "
"a VirtualBox, Vmware, etc."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何在 VMware 虚拟机托管的 Linux 环境中手动设置 SITL。您可以使用任何虚拟机提供商，如 VirtualBox、VMware "
"等。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:32
#: ce4380408b794b7cb5b26b6255f78e0b
msgid ""
"The instructions were tested on Windows 8 with VMware ver 7.1.0 "
"build-2496824 and Ubuntu 14.10."
msgstr "本说明在 Windows 8、VMware 版本 7.1.0 build-2496824 和 Ubuntu 14.10 上测试通过。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:39
#: b73b69f5f59243cfb6860264929bc5e4
msgid "Preconditions"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:41
#: 7b5b1546070541bbb86a355c01c72069
msgid ""
"Please note that before attempting this you should already have "
":ref:`downloaded the code <where-to-get-the-code>` to your machine."
msgstr "请注意，在尝试此操作之前，您应该已经将 :ref:`代码下载 <where-to-get-the-code>` 到您的计算机上。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:45
#: 79defb16b7514b58877bc553eb414bb7
msgid "Step #1 - Install VMWare and create an Ubuntu Virtual Machine"
msgstr "第 1 步 - 安装 VMWare 并创建 Ubuntu 虚拟机"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:47
#: 8134359216024a589f20540f8d4695a4
msgid ""
"Download and install `VMware "
"<https://my.vmware.com/web/vmware/free#desktop_end_user_computing/vmware_player/6_0>`__"
" (look for VMware Workstation Player for Windows)"
msgstr ""
"下载并安装 `VMware "
"<https://my.vmware.com/web/vmware/free#desktop_end_user_computing/vmware_player/6_0>`__（查找适用于"
" Windows 的 VMware Workstation Player）。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:49
#: a1c3e58dd80a49d28aaa067a4704f03c
msgid "Download the latest Ubuntu version : 22.04 LTS for example."
msgstr "下载最新版本的 Ubuntu，例如 22.04 LTS。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:51
#: 507564402ec2493cbbdf75b106df4a7f
msgid ""
"3. Start VMware and create new ubuntu machine by selecting Player > File > "
"New Virtual Machine"
msgstr "3. 启动 VMware，通过选择「播放器 > 文件 > 新建虚拟机」创建新的 Ubuntu 机器。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:54
#: 55cdc6532223400bbc357cd17ea56896
msgid "Select the iso you just downloaded"
msgstr "选择您刚刚下载的 ISO 镜像。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:55
#: 11efee3474f7405b8d8a7e6f53be3f59
msgid ""
"Enter your Full name, User name and Password for the virtual machine. you "
"will use these later when you log onto this virtual machine"
msgstr "输入虚拟机的全名、用户名和密码，您稍后登录该虚拟机时将使用这些信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:57
#: fd437d09b0e74cbdbb2499dd87d821f7
msgid "Name your virtual machine (i.e. Copter-SITL)"
msgstr "为虚拟机命名（例如 Copter-SITL）。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:58
#: 2140bd089c504b5d9d6101e8e781eb17
msgid ""
"Specify Disk Capacity - leave Max disk size as default 20GB, and \"Split "
"virtual disk into multiple files\" checked"
msgstr "指定磁盘容量——将最大磁盘大小保留为默认的 20GB，并勾选「将虚拟磁盘拆分为多个文件」。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:60
#: bb81c4355a304bdc8e215c50feb0a7ad
msgid ""
"On next page of \"New Virtual Machine Wizard\" click the \"Customize "
"Hardware..\" button"
msgstr "在「新建虚拟机向导」的下一页，点击「自定义硬件...」按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:62
#: 338182b190d94e40a2c3ba529a2fc037
msgid ""
"On the Hardware tab set Memory: 3GB,Processors: 4,Hard Disk: 20GB,Network "
"Adapter: NAT"
msgstr "在「硬件」选项卡上设置：内存：3GB，处理器：4 个，硬盘：20GB，网络适配器：NAT。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:69
#: 581dca6c64444add85845968b275e873
msgid "Step #2 - Start the VM for the first time"
msgstr "第 2 步 - 首次启动虚拟机"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:71
#: d13ec96da93043fa88c9802d40abadfc
msgid ""
"Power on the machine by double clicking on item just created in the VMware "
"Player"
msgstr "在 VMware Player 中双击刚刚创建的条目，为机器加电。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:73
#: e2de3948a1d94676b69f437d4d03bde1
msgid ""
"Press \"No\" to any questions like \"Cannot connect to the XXX device "
"because no corresponding device is available on the host\""
msgstr "对于类似「无法连接到 XXX 设备，因为主机上没有对应的可用设备」的问题，点击「否」。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:75
#: bf90da1b09904ea1905df1a5d771e393
msgid "Enter your password when the login screen appears"
msgstr "登录界面出现时输入您的密码。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:76
#: 2537647614a5496f842e40d3ed38c713
msgid "Say \"no\" to any options to upgrade versions"
msgstr "对任何升级版本的选项选择「否」。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:77
#: 36b4e22d4ed14ff59d917f7f34d471b3
msgid ""
"Open firefox and make sure it can access some web page like ardupilot.org"
msgstr "打开 Firefox，确保可以访问如 ardupilot.org 等网页。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:83
#: 1d1e3267116e4af5a2115efb4ead0b94
msgid ""
"Set the clock by double clicking on the top right corner, select your "
"location on the map and \"Set the time:\" to \"Automatically from the "
"internet\""
msgstr "通过双击右上角设置时钟，在地图上选择您的位置，并将「设置时间：」设为「自动从互联网同步」。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:87
#: e2222f76830748b6957fd57129467b4a
msgid "|Ubuntu_setTimezone|"
msgstr "|Ubuntu_setTimezone|"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst
#: 4659932386fc4417aac065be30ed71ce
msgid "Ubuntu_setTimezone"
msgstr "Ubuntu_setTimezone"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:88
#: 61d3f704497b4c44806700741b6e025f
msgid ""
"Setup a terminal short by clicking on the Dash Home icon on the top left, "
"Type \"terminal\" and then drag the terminal application to the left start "
"pane"
msgstr "通过点击左上角的「Dash Home」图标设置终端快捷方式，输入「terminal」，然后将终端应用程序拖到左侧启动栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:92
#: a1959d444bce43be828399eea6664577
msgid "|Ubuntu_TerminalShortcut|"
msgstr "|Ubuntu_TerminalShortcut|"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst
#: 268db8c6457a42c7b04ee9b5b8e1da7d
msgid "Ubuntu_TerminalShortcut"
msgstr "Ubuntu_TerminalShortcut"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:95
#: 94d08009e96b4ab986845f7d31d24c8d
msgid ""
"Step #3 - Setting up shared partition with Windows & Ubuntu Virtual Machine"
msgstr "第 3 步 - 设置 Windows 与 Ubuntu 虚拟机之间的共享分区"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:97
#: 9f65aabe1e7442219c2bd7099594e7df
msgid ""
"1. Ensure the VM is powered down by selecting its name, then select the "
"drop-down beside the green play button and select \"Power Off\" if it's not "
"greyed"
msgstr "1. 确认虚拟机已关机：选中其名称，然后点击绿色播放按钮旁边的下拉菜单，如果「关机」选项未置灰则点击它。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:104
#: f9dc1d7a87cf4c4ca1bfd63dc843e8e7
msgid ""
"2.On VMware Player select Player > Manage > Virtual Machine Settings... > "
"Options Tab > Shared Folders"
msgstr "2. 在 VMware Player 中选择「播放器 > 管理 > 虚拟机设置... > 选项选项卡 > 共享文件夹」。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:107
#: 2ec14e4cdde445fab8be172d090eb955
msgid "Check \"Always enabled\","
msgstr "勾选「始终启用」，"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:108
#: 48b75efb5efc474d8c174fadb3ebafca
msgid "Click \"Add...\""
msgstr "点击「添加...」"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:109
#: 224d70c0f0e7436983c465ea06174052
msgid ""
"Set \"Host Path\" to folder one level above where you have installed "
"ardupilot software"
msgstr "将「主机路径」设置为安装 ardupilot 软件目录的上一级目录。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:111
#: 3a3db1be10f34a8b828b4a349a1fb44e
msgid "Check \"Enable this share\""
msgstr "勾选「启用此共享」。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:116
#: 73b7dcf75d27474e88b3d4ea8b0f196b
msgid "Power on the VM, enter your login information"
msgstr "启动虚拟机，输入您的登录信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:118
#: ac4325ec01fa45acba1dfbbd59c26158
msgid ""
"4. Open Terminal window and type \"ls /mnt/hgfs\" and the share you set-up "
"should be visible"
msgstr "4. 打开终端窗口，输入「ls /mnt/hgfs」，您设置的共享文件夹应该可见。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:121
#: cb47c00c9fb442d1918c00512ec56c35
msgid ""
"5. type \"ln -s /mnt/hgfs/<foldername>\" (where <foldername> is replaced "
"with the name of the folder you set-up) to create a symbolic link to the "
"shared folder from your home directory"
msgstr ""
"5. 输入「ln -s /mnt/hgfs/<foldername>」（其中 <foldername> "
"替换为您设置的文件夹名称），从主目录创建到共享文件夹的符号链接。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:126
#: 8c261d1f3cea4443aa7ce74971723991
msgid "Step #4 - Follow the Linux instructions"
msgstr "第 4 步 - 按照 Linux 说明操作"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:128
#: eb567139a87c43aaa9cfad9dc1a62c6b
msgid ""
"Now that you have a Linux VM you should follow the :ref:`SITL instructions "
"for Linux <setting-up-sitl-on-linux>`"
msgstr ""
"现在您已经有了 Linux 虚拟机，请按照 :ref:`Linux 版 SITL 说明 <setting-up-sitl-on-linux>` "
"进行操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:133
#: d5fde680c3a24a1fac2bcbe6fcf9dadb
msgid "Connecting with the Mission Planner"
msgstr "通过 Mission Planner 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:135
#: c5076129bd124869832dbbfecc7feae9
msgid ""
"In addition to using the mavproxy ground station (the command line style "
"ground station written in python) it should be possible to connect with the "
"Mission Planner by appending the ``--viewerip=XXX.X.X.X`` to the end of the "
"start up command where the Xs are replaced with your machine's IP address.  "
"This address can be found by typing \"ipconfig\" into a command prompt."
msgstr ""
"除使用 mavproxy 地面站（用 Python 编写的命令行风格地面站）外，还可以通过在启动命令末尾附加 "
"``--viewerip=XXX.X.X.X`` 来使用 Mission Planner 连接，其中 X 替换为您机器的 IP "
"地址。该地址可通过在命令提示符中输入「ipconfig」找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:144
#: 11194f49edea41bab32c938bbd4326ce
msgid ""
"You will likely see many more than one IP address listed so you may need to "
"try a few different addresses to find one that works."
msgstr "您可能会看到列出的 IP 地址不止一个，因此可能需要尝试几个不同的地址才能找到有效的那个。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:150
#: 03b20f16f451439fa9674607f4763934
msgid ""
"So for this example the following would then be entered into the terminal on"
" the Ubuntu VM while in the ardupilot directory:"
msgstr "本示例中，在 ardupilot 目录下的 Ubuntu 虚拟机终端中输入以下命令："

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:157
#: 5be8e623a6594320896acf77e09aca7f
msgid ""
"Next connect with the mission planner after first setting the \"COM Port\" "
"to \"UDP\"."
msgstr "然后先将「COM 端口」设置为「UDP」，再通过 Mission Planner 连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:164
#: f311641035964553975b86519197f4ef
msgid "Dataflash logs"
msgstr "Dataflash 日志"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:166
#: 0821df5f24474312bf49666ca3ff8ed8
msgid ""
"After the simulation is run, dataflash logs named \"Copter.flashlog\" or "
"\"CopterAVC.flashlog\" will be created the \"buildlogs\" directory. This "
"directory is created at the same level as the ardupilot directory (i.e. the "
"top level directly that holds the \"Copter\", \"Plane\" and \"libraries\" "
"directories). Because of the inconvenient name you'll need to change the "
"file extension to \".log\" before opening in Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"仿真运行后，名为「Copter.flashlog」或「CopterAVC.flashlog」的 Dataflash "
"日志文件将在「buildlogs」目录中生成。该目录与 ardupilot "
"目录同级（即包含「Copter」、「Plane」和「libraries」目录的顶层目录）。由于文件名不便直接使用，在 Mission Planner "
"中打开之前，需要将文件扩展名更改为「.log」。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:174
#: 12a8abdda7e04bf9bfcd8fac798764b9
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "后续步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:176
#: 7f6019803b5d4600861af32c351923d9
msgid ""
"To get the most out of SITL we recommend you read the :ref:`MAVProxy "
"documentation <mavproxy:home>`."
msgstr "要充分发挥 SITL 的潜力，建议您阅读 :ref:`MAVProxy 文档 <mavproxy:home>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-on-windows.rst:178
#: b824c78c40a448919e3dacc9ecfcc21f
msgid ""
"The topic :ref:`Using SITL for ArduPilot Testing <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-"
"testing>` explains how to use the simulator, and covers topics like how to "
"use SITL with Ground Stations other than Mission Planner and MAVProxy."
msgstr ""
"主题 :ref:`使用 SITL 进行 ArduPilot 测试 <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>` "
"介绍了如何使用仿真器，并涵盖如何将 SITL 与 Mission Planner 和 MAVProxy 以外的地面站配合使用等主题。"
